ly around business rationalization, streamlining corporate overhead and eliminating duplicative public company costs, which on an annual basis totals $14 million and puts us well on our way to achieving our stated goal of $20 million…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/onto-innovation-onto-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ONTO 2020 Q1","e":"onto","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Roth","x":"Those synergies were primarily around business rationalization, streamlining corporate overheads and eliminating duplicative public company costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONTO 2020 Q1","e":"onto","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Roth","x":"However, our accelerated synergies and cost savings offset those increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONTO 2020 Q4","e":"onto","d":"2021-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael P. Plisinski","x":"To conclude the fourth quarter highlights, our new products are well positioned to support the transistor packaging architectures that are enabling new devices for AI and data center applications and the transition to 5G.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONTO 2020 Q4","e":"onto","d":"2021-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael P. Plisinski","x":"The continued proliferation of billions of connected devices and the massive amounts of data they send every second to the cloud is driving demand for the most advanced memory and logic devices to support new applications and artificial intelligence and high performance compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONTO 2021 Q1","e":"onto","d":"2021-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"Similar advances are being made in the advanced packaging and specialty markets, which continue to experience strong growth for multiple well-documented drivers in 5G high performance compute and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONTO 2021 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Roth","x":"So we haven't seen any material price increases hit the numbers yet, but I think that's a risk that's out there that we keep looking at.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/onto-innovation-inc-onto-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONTO 2025 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"Market growth in 2026 is likely to include increased investments in advanced packaging to support the strong demand for AI compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2025 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"Looking at the markets broadly, recent headlines continue to reflect strong and sustained demand for AI and high-performance compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2025 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"These efforts will enhance our competitive position, mitigate tariff impacts, provide greater manufacturing flexibility, and allow us to expand gross margins in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2025 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian K. Roberts","x":"Gross margin for Q3 2025 was 54%, and includes approximately a one percentage point impact related to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2026 Q1","e":"onto","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael P. Plisinski","x":"The Onto Innovation Inc. team is off to an outstanding start to the year as the momentum in our business continues to build in support of strong demand for AI compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/onto-onto-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2026 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"More importantly, it reflects our customers' conviction that AI will be the most significant investment catalyst in the history of the semiconductor industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2026 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2026-11-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"That's a good thing because the GPU demand continues to go up or the AI processor demand goes up, that's also a good thing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2026 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2026-11-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Plisinski","x":"…team, as we've talked a bunch, I mean, the team has done a really good job, I think, around leveraging the extended factory model, which allows for lower cost labor markets, our ability to be able to eliminate some of the duties and tariff risks that were certainly impacting the business in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/onto-innovation-onto-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONTO 2026 Q3","e":"onto","d":"2026-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian 